    "detailed_description": "Welcome to a by the climate change burnt world,<br>a place that can be saved by only one hero: Gobbo<br> <br>Deal with the evil and ugly Desert Devils in any possible way<br>and use the environment cleverly, for example with the rusty conveyor belts to solve tricky puzzles in this dirty post industrial but funny adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440320/extras/78ad6576aa7636eb19b614895fae984d.poster.avif?t=1734104464\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440320/extras/78ad6576aa7636eb19b614895fae984d.webm?t=1734104464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440320/extras/78ad6576aa7636eb19b614895fae984d.mp4?t=1734104464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Controll your character in four isometric directions and drag &amp; drop objects to combine them with others on sky reflecting solar panels!<br><br>The game was originally developed in 2011 and is based on the 3D character Gobbo.<br>Thought to be a spirtual sequel to FunnyPizzaLand Gobbo goes adventures can today be seen as a proper titel and a missing link between FPL and FPL2,<br>in a future far, far away.<br><br>Every 3D rendering, every hand drawn cloud,<br>- the world of Gobbo goes adventures has been put together by Solo dev and artist Roman.<br><br>Key Features:<br>. surreal comic art style<br>. five crazy quests full of puzzles<br>. spirtual sequel to FunnyPizzaLand<br>. prerendered 3D hero in a hand drawn world<br>. No dialogues - all quests are explained visually, undertoned with the universal voice of industry<br>. finally a game to do something about global warming!<br>. Playtime: a couple of hours<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440320/extras/2c42a96fbc8e81211f3ebbcf47291bb9.poster.avif?t=1734104464\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440320/extras/2c42a96fbc8e81211f3ebbcf47291bb9.webm?t=1734104464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440320/extras/4fa6b97a45d45d5bda0780848ff60f29.avif?t=1734104464\" /></span>",
